<Base title="About">
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>I'm Stephen Abrams. I have a background in mathematics, physics, philosophy, and computer science, and I work in analytics and data engineering in Louisville, KY.</p>
    <p>This site is where I write about probability, puzzles, games, and the projects I build.</p>
    <h2>Why "Convergent Blue"?</h2>
    <p>From 2006 to 2020 I wrote at <em>divergentblue.com</em>. The domain lapsed, and someone else now runs it. <strong>It is not affiliated with me. Please don't enter any information there.</strong> The posts worth keeping were restored from an old backup and live here now.</p>
    <p>The name is a nod to a series that finally settled down.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
